280
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:48,399
convolution without distortion at the

281
00:10:45,680 --> 00:10:50,480
edges.

282
00:10:48,399 --> 00:10:52,320
We'll explore this zero padding step in

283
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:56,600
