299
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:43,440
that look like ramps in opposite

300
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:45,600
directions. The convolution produces a

301
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:47,760
sequence that starts small, rises to a

302
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:49,920
peak here at the center, and then falls

303
00:11:47,760 --> 00:11:51,839
