456
00:17:45,840 --> 00:17:49,679
inverse FFT to return to the time

457
00:17:48,000 --> 00:17:51,760
domain.

458
00:17:49,679 --> 00:17:54,480
When we plot the result, we see that the

459
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:57,039
