470
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:19,720
convolution.

471
00:18:21,600 --> 00:18:25,520
Now that we've explored convolution in

472
00:18:23,520 --> 00:18:27,919
detail both in the time domain and

473
00:18:25,520 --> 00:18:29,679
through the FFT method, let's move into

474
00:18:27,919 --> 00:18:31,919
one of the most common and powerful

475
00:18:29,679 --> 00:18:34,480
applications of the Fier transform

476
00:18:31,919 --> 00:18:36,720
spectral analysis.

477
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:38,640
Spectral analysis is about looking at a

478
00:18:36,720 --> 00:18:40,559
